  <data name="HomePage_MergeTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Live Photo Merge</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_MergeDesc.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Converts Apple Live Photos into single files using various Android protocols, allowing them to be viewed on devices such as Windows. Currently, only (JPG photos + MOV/MP4 video) is supported; (HEIC/HEIF photos + MOV/MP4 video) Live Photos are not yet supported. Support for HEIC/HEIF formats, as well as Live Photos packaged as HEIF files, will be added in the future.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_MergeUsage.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Place the prepared (photos JPG + MOV/MP4 video) in the same folder, and click "Start Combining".</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_SplitTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Live Photo Split</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_SplitDesc.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The existing single-file live photos are losslessly unpacked to extract the original still images and dynamic videos.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_SplitUsage.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Select the folder of photos you want to split, and click "Start Splitting".</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_RepairTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Thumbnail Repair</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_RepairDesc.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This is the main event: fixing the issue mentioned in the above description where Apple photo thumbnails rotate when viewed from the front and stretch in versions prior to iOS 17.3. If you encounter any other new issues, please report them on the About or Settings page.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_RepairUsage.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Select the problematic Live Photos, and the program will automatically reconstruct the metadata to bring them back to life.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_KeyPhotoTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Key Photo Switch</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_WIPLabel.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>WIP 🚧</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_KeyPhotoDesc.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Freely change the cover photo of your Live Photo, picking the perfect moment from the dynamic frame.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HomePage_KeyPhotoUsage.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Stay tuned! We are working hard to build this feature and it will meet you soon.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutPage_MotivationTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Motivation</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutPage_MotivationContent.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The author habitually backs up photos to their computer due to limited storage space on their phone. However, Apple's Live Photos function on Windows results in separate images and videos, leading to a terrible browsing experience. Frustrated, the author developed this tool, finally liberating this perfectionist! []~(￣▽￣)~*</value>
  </data>
